* One Kafka broker fails during business hours. How would you verify that the cluster remains available and determine whether any messages were lost?
* A producer reports successful sends, but downstream consumers cannot find some records after a broker failure. Which configurations and logs would you inspect?
* Your application requires strict ordering of events for each customer. How would you design topic keys and partitioning?
